        <content type="html" xml:base="/events/2013-07-02-coding-standards-devtools-encodings/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-1-your-coding-standard-matters&quot;&gt;Talk 1: Your (coding) standard matters&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A short discussion of current practices surrounding two of PHP&#x27;s quality assurance tools: &lt;a href=&quot;http:&#x2F;&#x2F;pear.php.net&#x2F;manual&#x2F;en&#x2F;package.php.php-codesniffer.php&quot;&gt;PHPCS&lt;&#x2F;a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http:&#x2F;&#x2F;phpmd.org&#x2F;&quot;&gt;PHPMD&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;. Let&#x27;s discuss what value they provide for your teams and how to configure them to your liking.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;twitter.com&#x2F;__edorian&quot;&gt;Volker Dusch&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-2-devtools&quot;&gt;Talk 2: Devtools&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tools for the daily developer work.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;twitter.com&#x2F;woodworker&quot;&gt;Martin Holzhauer&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-3-character-building&quot;&gt;Talk 3: Character Building&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fun with charsets and encodings.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
